<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's April iron, steel import prices down.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's April iron, steel import prices down.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's iron and steel import prices were down in April from the previous month, the Association of Foreign Trading Agents of Korea (AFTAK) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Import prices of iron and steel were as follows:</p>
<p>(price per tonne on C&amp;F)</p>
<p> COMMODITY		 Origin     Apr	 Mar</p>
<p> Pig iron		  China	170	 173</p>
<p> Scrap iron		U.S.	 148	 148</p>
<p> Billet		    Japan	256	 260</p>
<p> Hot coil		  Japan	330	 330</p>
<p> Slab			Brazil     262	 258</p>
<p> Stainless hot coil    Japan    1,560     1,560</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
